{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は乃木フニャでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんとみなみと中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただただ楽しかったです\n仕事感が本当に無かった（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり自由な番組でしたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも美味しいご飯食べて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くから作ってくださったみたいなんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"至れり尽せりありがたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冒頭のラップの無茶ぶりも\n許せますね！！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラスト90秒で言いかけて\nブログに書きますって言ってた話は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AbemaTVに出てもらえませんか？って\n道で声かけられた事がある\nって話でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46万人を動かす程の話じゃなくてごめん（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ラストには50万超えてたみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/05/14/1589725/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜の乃木のの\n出演させてもらってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先々週、\n出演させていただきたばっかりなのに\n嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は蘭世とです～\nよろしく～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかだかな"}],"source":"archive"}